  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/10/AcousticDruida1.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(47 fotos) Druida bar&amp;drinks, en la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 de Onda, ha iniciado la noche de este viernes los actos de su 10&ordm; aniversario con la &#39;Acoustic Night&#39; a cargo de Dani Catal&aacute;n y Astrid Canales.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/10/AcousticDruida2.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Al final de concierto se ha sumado Joan Fonfria.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acousticnigthdruida/img_0123.jpg\" alt=\"img_0123\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acousticnigthdruida/img_0126.jpg\" alt=\"img_0126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acousticnigthdruida/img_0127.jpg\" alt=\"img_0127\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acousticnigthdruida/img_0131.jpg\" alt=\"img_0131\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acousticnigthdruida/img_0135.jpg\" alt=\"img_0135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acousticnigthdruida/img_0136.jpg\" alt=\"img_0136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acousticnigthdruida/img_0138.jpg\" alt=\"img_0138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/acousticnigthdruida/img_0140.jpg\" alt=\"img_0140\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439e